{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:0.4"], "en": "6. The Upasāḷaka Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:1.1", "PA_ja_166:1.2"], "en": "\"Fourteen thousand [monks] named Upasāḷaka;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:1.3"], "en": "In this place all things are consumed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:1.4"], "en": "there is nothing in the world that remains unburnt.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:2.1"], "en": "In whom truth and Dhamma abide—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:2.2"], "en": "Non-violence, self-restraint, and self-control:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:2.3"], "en": "these the noble ones cultivate;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:2.4"], "en": "these in the world are beyond reproach.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_166:3.1"], "en": "The Upasāḷaka Jātaka, the sixth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
